WEBVTT

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Leave tonight.

00:05.600 --> 00:10.640
First I am truly worried about Father's health second our dynasty values filial piety.

00:10.720 --> 00:15.867
If I don't return I'm afraid it will give Prince Ning ammunition to criticize me in court.

00:21.500 --> 00:29.000
Half a month later, you led a troop of personal guards back to the capital to visit the Emperor.

00:29.080 --> 00:32.000
Supplies burned to ashes, military resolve faltered. Xie Xuan fought on alone for days, but was ultimately overwhelmed by vastly superior numbers, resulting in the annihilation of his entire army.

00:35.600 --> 00:40.360
Elder brother father's health His Majesty is unwell.

00:40.760 --> 00:46.147
Resting in a separate palace all palace affairs are all handled by me.

00:49.240 --> 00:50.640
Elder brother.

00:51.360 --> 00:53.027
I want to see Father.

00:59.760 --> 01:05.680
Second brother all these years you've been fighting with blades and swords you've been wild enough.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.427
Today let me welcome you back.

01:11.880 --> 01:14.213
Elder brother, I want to see Father.

01:15.000 --> 01:17.000
Elder brother, what are you doing?

01:18.520 --> 01:19.920
Sikong Zheng.

01:32.880 --> 01:37.760
I really didn't want it to come to this but second brother.

01:39.120 --> 01:44.760
You already have a foundation in the army how can I, the crown prince sleep peacefully?

